SUMMARY:City of Lancaster Mayor Arroyo's Town Hall - Northeast Quadrant
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Lancaster\, PA for the next Mayor’s Town Hall! \n\nWhen: Wednesday\, July 22\, 2026 from 5:30 to 7:30 p.m.\nWhere: McCaskey East Gymnasium at 1051 Lehigh Avenue\n\nJoin Mayor Jaime Arroyo and other City of Lancaster staff to learn more about and give feedback on projects going on city-wide and in the northeast neighborhood. \nAmerican Sign Language (ASL) and Spanish interpretation will be available.
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/city-of-lancaster-mayor-arroyos-town-hall-northeast-quadrant/
LOCATION:McCaskey East Gym\, United States
CATEGORIES:McCaskey East HS,McCaskey HS
END:VEVENT
