SUMMARY:2026 College send-off celebration RSVP deadline
DESCRIPTION:The School District of Lancaster invites members of the McCaskey Class of 2026 who are continuing their education after high school to join us for our annual College Send-Off Celebration. \nThis special event recognizes graduates as they prepare to begin the next chapter of their academic journey. Students will have the opportunity to connect with classmates before heading to campuses across the country while celebrating this exciting milestone with the McCaskey community. \nEvent Details \n\nDate: Thursday\, Aug. 6\, 2026\nTime: 4:30 p.m.\nLocation: McCaskey East Cafeteria\n\nGraduates are encouraged to RSVP by Monday\, July 27 using the QR code or the registration link below. \nWe look forward to celebrating the Class of 2026 and wishing them continued success as they begin their college experience. \nClick here to RSVP 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/2026-college-send-off-celebration-rsvp-deadline/
LOCATION:McCaskey East Cafeteria\, 1051 Lehigh Avenue\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:McCaskey East HS,McCaskey HS
END:VEVENT
